 "note": "Turkey Hill Middle School. The page prints only 'FACULTY'; it follows the Turkey Hill report that ends page 50 ('...which Turkey Hill Middle School made this year'), and the OFFICE block (Keith Hochstein, Principal; Harris Karis, Asst. Principal) matches the 2001 Turkey Hill roster. Two columns (x 0.18 / 0.54), each section heading governing the names below it, recorded in grade_or_dept; the column rows are offset from each other, so the grade lists start above the OFFICE block. Titles printed after the comma (Principal, Nurse, Music, PE, Foreign Languages ...) go in role_raw. Vivian Butler is printed twice, under SEVENTH GRADE (line 25) and LEARNING CENTER (line 50); both are recorded as printed. Line 53 is the page number."
